<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000463> rdfs:label "Anteverted nares"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Anteriorly-facing nostrils viewed with the head in the Frankfurt horizontal and the eyes of the observer level with the eyes of the subject. This gives the appearance of an upturned nose (upturned nasal tip)." ;
