<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000709> rdfs:label "Psychosis" ;
    dcterms:description "A condition characterized by changes in personality and thought patterns, often accompanied by hallucinations and delusional beliefs, is known as psychosis."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
