<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001907> rdfs:label "Thromboembolism"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "The formation of a blood clot inside a blood vessel that subsequently travels through the blood stream from the site where it formed to another location in the body, generally leading to vascular occlusion at the distant site."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
