<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000054> rdfs:label "Micropenis" ;
    dcterms:description "Abnormally small penis. At birth, the normal penis is about 3 cm (stretched length from pubic tubercle to tip of penis) with micropenis less than 2.0-2.5 cm."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
