<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001629> rdfs:label "Ventricular septal defect"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A hole between the two bottom chambers (ventricles) of the heart. The defect is centered around the most superior aspect of the ventricular septum." ;
