    dcterms:description "A predominantly neutrophilic infiltrate of the dermis and or epidermis (i.e., a large number of neutrophils inferred to have migrated into the skin)." ;
    ns1:category ns1:PhenotypicFeature .

<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032154> rdfs:label "Aphthous ulcer" ;
