        "UMLS:C0029124"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> .

<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000708> rdfs:label "Atypical behavior" ;
    dcterms:description "Atypical behavior is an abnormality in a person's actions that can be controlled or modulated by the will of the individual. While abnormal behaviors can be difficult to control, they are distinct from other abnormal actions that cannot be affected by the individual's will."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
