<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0040186> rdfs:label "Maculopapular exanthema"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A skin rash that is characterized by diffuse cutaneous erythema with areas of skin elevation. It may evolve to vesicles or papules as part of a more severe clinical entity. Different degrees of angioedema with involvement of subcutaneous tissue may also appear."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
