<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001055> rdfs:label "Erysipelas"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Increased susceptibility to erysipelas, as manifested by a medical history of repeated episodes of erysipelas, which is a superficial infection of the skin, typically involving the lymphatic system."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
